AB  - This article gives a comparative overview of three of the top large language models (LLMs) in February 2025: Gemini 2.0 Pro (Google), DeepSeek-R1 (DeepSeek AI), and ChatGPT (OpenAI). The article begins with summarizing the general working patterns of LLMs, i.e., the transformer architecture on which they are developed. The architecture, features, performance parameters, and usage for each model are described. A battery of tests drawn from standardized benchmarks such as MMLU-Pro, LiveCodeBench, and MATH-500 are used to assess their performance in areas such as reason, code generation, and response time.
